    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA rare opportunity to acquire a prime infill development site extending to approximately 0.056 acres (0.0226 hectares), ideally located in the heart of Killarney town, just off High Street.The site is accessed via Bowers Lane and benefits from a highly convenient town-centre location, within easy walking distance of a comprehensive range of amenities and services.Planning & Development PotentialThe site is zoned for Town Centre Facilities, offering significant potential for a range of uses, subject to the necessary planning approvals.Potential development options may include:• A small residential scheme comprising four townhouses• A mixed-use development incorporating office accommodation at ground-floor level with apartments overhead• Potential for development of up to three storeys, subject to planning permissionServicesMains services, including water, sewage, electricity and broadband, are understood to be immediately available to the site.LocationThe property enjoys an exceptionally convenient town-centre location, with High Street and Killarney's extensive range of amenities within easy walking distance. Nearby facilities include retail and commercial units, shops, gyms, medical facilities, pharmacies, cafés and restaurants.Development OpportunityThe property represents an excellent investment opportunity and is ideally suited to a builder or developer seeking a manageable town centre project with strong potential, subject to planning permission."
      },
